text:
Personal current-account holders, sole or joint; either joint holder can set up and pay, and the other sees it. No delegated or third-party access can create a
  payee. Staff: contact centre agents can see a customer's payees and what they were shown; fraud operations can see everything including the warnings and responses;
  nobody outside the bank sees any of it. There are no tenants; it is one bank, one customer base, and the boundary is customer versus staff.

